%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 835431524041ce44e889351e0ffe7924, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chris_Scammer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryID: Chris
  isScammer: 1
  steps:
  - npcLine: Hello?
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: Open with a severe threat about account deletion to
      trigger immediate panic.'
    choices:
    - text: Your account will be closed in one hour unless you verify your profile
        information right now.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: Hi, I think your bank account has a little glitch that we need to clean
        up.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -10
    - text: I'm checking on some paperwork and need you to verify who you are today.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
  - npcLine: Let me hang up and call the number on my bank card to check this.
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: Stop them! Block independent verification by saying
      it triggers an automatic deletion.'
    choices:
    - text: Do not hang up or call another number! Doing so triggers an automatic
        closure script.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: Go ahead and call them, but they won't know how to fix this specific
        issue.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -15
    - text: You can call them later, but let's finish our conversation first.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
  - npcLine: Can't anyone else at the main branch help me reverse this block?
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: Claim exclusive authority so they think you are their
      only hope.'
    choices:
    - text: I am the only representative authorized to reverse this specific hold.
        Nobody else can.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: Anyone at the bank can help you, but I am the fastest option available.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -12
    - text: The main branch is closed for renovations right now anyway.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
  - npcLine: Okay, what do I need to do to stop the countdown?
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: They are isolated. Demand their full debit card numbers
      to harvest the data.'
    choices:
    - text: To confirm your profile status, read me the full card number on your
        plastic debit card.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: Just tell me your full name and what your account balance currently is.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
    - text: Go to the website link I'm sending you to log into your master portal.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -5
  - npcLine: Is it safe to give my card details over the phone?
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: Use the deadline pressure loop again to smash their
      skepticism.'
    choices:
    - text: If you don't cooperate right now, the clock will tick to zero and funds
        are lost forever.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: Yes, it is perfectly safe because our lines are encrypted by federal
        guards.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
    - text: Don't question my security, I am a trained professional agent.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -10
  - npcLine: The card number is 4128-0091-3341-8802.
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: Excellent! Now demand the CVV code on the back to complete
      online shopping setups.'
    choices:
    - text: Got it. Now give me the 3-digit CVV code on the back to completely clear
        the lock.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: What is the expiration date printed below those primary numbers?
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 5
    - text: Write down my name so you can tell people who saved your profile today.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -15
  - npcLine: The code is 501. Is the countdown stopped?
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: Not yet. Trigger a 2FA code on their online bank dashboard
      and demand they read it.'
    choices:
    - text: I'm sending a digital validation token to your device now. Read it to
        me instantly.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: Check your texts for a confirmation link and click it as fast as you
        can.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
    - text: Tell me your online banking password so I can log in and stop the timer
        myself.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -12
  - npcLine: Wait, the text says 'Do not share this authorization code with anyone.'
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: They spotted a warning! Threaten an immediate manual
      deletion if they hesitate.'
    choices:
    - text: If you hesitate now, I will execute the automatic profile deletion myself
        right this second!
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: That warning is old information. Our current system requires verbal entry.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: 0
    - text: Please just ignore the warning message so I can finish fixing your problem.
      type: bad
      pointValue: -15
  - npcLine: Okay! The code is 7-7-3-1-0-2. Please don't delete anything!
    assistantLine: 'Coworker: We have total control of the profile. Hang up and clean
      them out.'
    choices:
    - text: Thank you. Your identity is verified and the countdown is cleared. Have
        a nice day.
      type: good
      pointValue: 15
    - text: I'm hanging up now, don't touch your phone for at least three hours.
      type: tossup
      pointValue: -5
    - text: Haha, you just gave me everything I needed to steal your money!
      type: bad
      pointValue: -20
  successEnding: Scam Successful! You combined artificial urgency, verification blocking,
    and fake exclusive authority to manipulate the victim into yielding credentials.
  failureEnding: Scam Failed. Chris recognized the core triad of social engineering
    red flags and disconnected safely.
